p: .
t: Based on my experience, I recognize From Madness to Mutiny as an
important book for those who prioritize child safety, particularly for
children whose parents are involved with Family Court


--- Sentence/switch
i: 10
r# 946

p: .
t:  Those who
are abused come in all genders


--- Sentence/switch
i: 11
r# 989

p: .
t:  The LGBTQ+ community, particularly
transgender women, have high rates of intimate partner abuse


--- Sentence/switch
i: 12
r# 1087

p: .
t:  I do not
doubt that allegations of parental alienation, where the abusive partner accuses the other of undermining the child's relationship with the
abuser, is a tactic used in queer relationships, as well


--- Sentence/switch
i: 13
r# 1295

p: .
t:  Until recently
in the course of legal history, courts have not entertained a significant
number of child custody cases involving members of the queer community, and even fewer that have been appealed


--- Sentence/switch
i: 14
r# 1497

p: .
t:  As such, which tactics are
used for certain to disparage the abused partner in queer relationships
have not been widely reviewed


--- Sentence/switch
i: 15
r# 1628

p: .
t:  That field is ripe for study and analysis,
although it is still in its incipience


--- Sentence/switch
i: 16
r# 1712

p: .
t:  This is why the reader will find that
the case studies referenced in this present book focus on tactics used
primarily by men to discredit women


--- Sentence/switch
i: 17
r# 1859

p: .
t:  Mothers are the primary targets
of the tactics of abusive men in custody cases


--- Sentence/switch
i: 18
r# 1940

p: .
t:  While men can be targets
of unfair allegations in custody cases, the number of fathers experiencing targeted strategies of abuse and coercion in hetero relationships are
a small minority

--- Sentence/end 
